+/**
+ * uclamp_util_with - clamp @util with @rq and @p effective uclamp values.
+ * @rq:		the rq to read the clamp values from.
+ * @util:	the utilization to clamp.
+ * @p:		the task whose clamp values are used; may be NULL.
